//       // verified live 2026-07-29 via curl → 200 OK on
//       // https://token-plan.ap-southeast-1.maas.aliyuncs.com/apps/anthropic/v1/messages).
//       // Auth: {env:ALIBABA_TOKEN_PLAN_API_KEY} (the Anthropic-format token-plan
//       // route rejects the bare RAM AccessKey pair with 401 InvalidApiKey).
//       //
//       // baseURL already includes the trailing /v1 because @ai-sdk/anthropic
//       // appends only /messages (unlike its own default of
//       // https://api.anthropic.com/v1, which has the /v1 baked in). Omitting it
//       // 404s every request.
//       //
//       // Only the preview model carries an explicit thinking.budgetTokens; the
//       // rest rely on the provider default per user instruction.
